#: templates/core/index.html:62
msgid ""
"Somos una empresa Colombo-Española con amplia experiencia en "
"comercialización internacional de productos no perecederos, principalmente "
"derivados de maderas cultivadas (Teca, Melina, Pino, Roble, Árbol de café y "
"Cedro), procedentes de bosques legales en distintas regiones de Colombia. "
"También exportamos café y cacao de la más alta calidad."
msgstr ""
"We are a Colombian-Spanish company with extensive experience in the "
"international trade of non-perishable products, primarily cultivated wood "
"derivatives (Teak, Melina, Pine, Oak, Coffee Tree, and Cedar), sourced from "
"legally managed forests across various regions of Colombia. We also export "
"the highest-quality coffee and cocoa"

