#: templates/core/nosotros.html:13
msgid "Conectamos productores colombianos con el mundo."
msgstr "We connect Colombian producers with the world."

#: templates/core/nosotros.html:15
msgid ""
"Nacimos en el corazón del Eje Cafetero en 2010, con la misión de conectar "
"pequeños productores con grandes mercados globales. Hoy, enviamos más de 400"
" contenedores al año a los cinco continentes."
msgstr ""
"We were founded in the heart of Colombia’s Coffee Triangle in 2010 with the "
"mission of connecting small producers to major global markets. Today, we "
"ship over 400 containers annually to all five continents."

